{"metadata":{"title":"stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","modules":[{"name":"MiamiStateMachine"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stateStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"StateStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Continuation","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BufferingPolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"StateStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C11stateStream15bufferingPolicyScSyq_GScS12ContinuationV09BufferingG0Oyq___G_tF"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stateStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV","text":"Continuation"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO","text":"BufferingPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .unbounded) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"bufferingPolicy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How states are buffered until they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumed. By default all of them, without any limit. A consumer only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interested in where the state machine is now, and not in the states"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it passed on the way, can use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".bufferingNewest(1)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new stream of states, starting with the current state."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current state is delivered at once, so a stream tells where the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state machine is whenever it is created. This makes it a good fit for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user interface. To know how a state was entered, or to not miss any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition, use "},{"code":"transitionStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A transition leading back to the same state delivers the state again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A rejected event delivers nothing, as the state machine stays where it is."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every call creates a new stream, independent of all other streams."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Several consumers can each have a stream of their own, and all of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them get every state. Cancelling the task of a consumer, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"letting go of a stream, ends only that stream."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stream finishes when the state machine reaches an ending state,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after delivering that state. A stream created at an ending state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivers the state and finishes. The stream also finishes if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state machine is deallocated."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream(bufferingpolicy:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a stream of the states the state machine is at. It starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the current state, followed by the state entered by every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition made from now on, in the order they are made."}],"references":{"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateMachine"}],"type":"topic","title":"StateMachine","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateMachine"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A state machine is an actor with a current state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a set of transitions defining the machine. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"TransitionRule","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connects two states by an event trigger."}]},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/StateStream":{"title":"StateMachine.StateStream","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StateStream"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"StateStream","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A stream of the states a state machine is at, one after the other.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/StateStream"},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","title":"MiamiStateMachine","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine","type":"topic","abstract":[]},"doc://MiamiStateMachine/documentation/MiamiStateMachine/StateMachine/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)":{"title":"stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/miamistatemachine\/statemachine\/statestream(bufferingpolicy:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stateStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"bufferingPolicy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV","text":"Continuation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS12ContinuationV15BufferingPolicyO","text":"BufferingPolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B6Streama","text":"StateStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a stream of the states the state machine is at. It starts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the current state, followed by the state entered by every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition made from now on, in the order they are made."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/stateStream(bufferingPolicy:)"}}}